      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <title>Budget Tracker (L4–L1)</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n    <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n  </head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <h1>Budget Tracker</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Simple app to add up expenses.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"container\">\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <button id=\"add5\" class=\"btn\">Add $5</button>\n        <button id=\"add10\" class=\"btn\">Add $10</button>\n        <button id=\"clearBtn\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Clear</button>\n        <button id=\"msgBtn\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Show Message</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"display\">\n        <div class=\"label\">Total</div>\n        <div id=\"totalDisplay\" class=\"value\">$0.00</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p id=\"hint\" class=\"hint\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <small>Writing Reusable Functions</small>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": ":root{\n  --bg:#f7f8ff; \n  --panel:#ffffff; \n  --ink:#0e1328; \n  --muted:#6b7280;\n  --accent:#4f46e5; \n  --accent-ink:#eef2ff; \n  --ring:rgba(79,70,229,.25);\n}\n\n*{\n  box-sizing:border-box\n}\n\nbody{\n  margin:0; \n  font:16px/1.45 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;\n  color:var(--ink); \n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f8ff,#eff3ff);\n}\n\n.site-header,.site-footer{ \n  text-align:center; \n  padding:20px 12px }\n.site-header h1{ margin:.25rem 0 \n}\n\n.lede{ \n  margin:0; \n  color:var(--muted) \n}\n\n.container{ \n  max-width:760px; \n  margin:0 auto; \n  padding:16px \n}\n\n.card{\n  background:var(--panel); \n  border:1px solid #e5e7eb; \n  border-radius:14px;\n  padding:18px; \n  box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(16,20,40,.06)\n}\n\n.row{ \n  display:flex; \n  gap:10px; \n  flex-wrap:wrap; \n  margin-bottom:14px \n}\n\n.btn{\n  border:1px solid #d1d5db; \n  background:#fff; \n  color:var(--ink);\n  padding:10px 14px; \n  border-radius:10px; \n  cursor:pointer; \n  font-weight:600\n}\n\n.btn:hover{ \n  box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--ring) \n}\n\n.btn-secondary{ \n  background:#111827; \n  color:#fff; \n  border-color:#111827 \n}\n\n.btn-ghost{ \n  background:#eef2ff; \n  border-color:#c7d2fe; \n  color:#3730a3 \n}\n\n.display{\n  display:flex; \n  align-items:baseline; \n  gap:10px; \n  margin-top:4px\n}\n\n.display .label{ \n  color:var(--muted) \n}\n\n.display .value{ \n  font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,36px); font-weight:800 \n}\n\n.hint{ \n  color:var(--muted); \n  min-height:1.25rem; \n  margin:.5rem 0 0 \n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// variable for total amount\nlet total = 0;\n\n// references to display elements and buttons\nconst totalDisplay = document.getElementById(\"totalDisplay\");\nconst hint = document.getElementById(\"hint\");\n\nconst add5 = document.getElementById(\"add5\");\nconst add10 = document.getElementById(\"add10\");\nconst clearBtn = document.getElementById(\"clearBtn\");\nconst msgBtn = document.getElementById(\"msgBtn\");\n\nfunction updateTotal() {\n  totalDisplay.textContent = \"$\" + total.toFixed(2);\n  hint.textContent = \"\";\n}\n\nfunction doIt() {\n  total = total + 5;\n  updateTotal();\n}\n\nfunction f1() {\n  total = total + 10;\n  updateTotal();\n}\n\nfunction clr() {\n  total = 0;\n  updateTotal();\n}\n\nfunction x() {\n  hint.textContent = 'Tip: \"Never spend your money before you have it.\" — Thomas Jefferson';\n}\n\n// connects each button to its function\nadd5.addEventListener(\"click\", doIt);\nadd10.addEventListener(\"click\", f1);\nclearBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", clr);\nmsgBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", x);\n\n// initial display\nupdateTotal();\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "1",
        "2",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    "long_instructions": "#What's in a name?\r\n\r\n1. **Test** each button. Observe and think about what each button does.\r\n2. **Replace** each vague function name in `script.js` with a **verb-first** specific name, like **calculateTip**.\r\n3. **Add a comment** using `//` above each function explaining what it does in one short sentence. \r\n4. (Optional) **Chat with AI** to rate the clarity of your function names and suggest alternates if needed. ",
